WMFirew - Public release
-----------------------------------------------------------
Authors...: Dave Turner (turnerd@reed.edu)

Note......: I first thought of this a few years ago, and then forgot about it.  When I started making dock applets it came to mind again.


Credits...: Thanks to Dag Wieers (dag@digibel.be) for wmpong, on which this is based.


Description
-----------------------------------------------------------
Draws fireworks, which go up and explode. Intended for a
windowmaker/afterstep dock/wharf applet.  I haven't actually tested it on 
windowmaker, only afterstep.


Files
-----------------------------------------------------------
README		This file.
INSTALL		Installation instructions.
BUGS		Description of little creatures.
COPYING		GNU General Public License Version 2.


Bugs
--------------------------------------------------------------
If you discover any bugs in this software, please send a
bug report to turnerd@reed.edu and describe the problem in as much 
detail as you can.  Better yet, fix it.  
